OL,3,GNEWSAPensioner arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Awoman's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder following the death of a woman
OL,8,Fin her 70s.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police said emergency
OL,11,Fservices were called to a property on
OL,12,FSherbourne Avenue in Bradley Stoke,
OL,13,Fnear Bristol, at around 14:00 BST.
OL,15,FThe victim was found with serious
OL,16,Finjuries and was pronounced dead at the
OL,17,Fscene. A man, also in his 70s, has been
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of murder, police
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
