OL,3,GNEWSAPensioner arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Awoman's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupt Karen Corrigan said: "This will
OL,7,Fcome as a great shock to the community,
OL,8,Fbut we do not consider there to be any
OL,9,Fongoing risk to the public."
